            "notes": "[Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) synergize so well with Mercy's kit, so I feel I do her a disservice by not leaning into it with  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n\nTake [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) against [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power).\n\nTake [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) against [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).\n\n## **Playstyle:**\nPlay Mercy as usual. Watch your angles and keep your beam constantly active. Focus healing for easy cash and ult charge, but keep in mind to use your damage boost whenever your healing isn't needed. I aim for a 60%/40% split, personally, but so long as your team is alive and enabled by you you're set.",
