            "notes": "Sell [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and...\n\n## **$20,000**\nBuy [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124), and any Blue and Green items you can afford. Prioritize [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).\n\n## **Under $20,000**\nSell [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) as well and try to catch up on any Blue items you may have missed before. [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), and Survival are all things you cannot go wrong with.\n\n## **Chain Evoker: Is it worth it?**\nI personally prioritize heals over damage boost so I do not get much use out of this item, but if you are a blue beam mercy this could help you stack up that sweet, sweet ult charge just a little easier. It's not the best use of cash in my opinion, but I can imagine it having a purpose in the right hands. Now would be the time to grab it if you want it.\n\n## **Playstyle:**\nNo matter what, keep playing smart and safe. You can't help your team if you're dead, so prioritize your safety so you can guarantee theirs.\n\nKeep playing as you normally would. Focus heals, juggle your beam to keep [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) active, and watch that sweet cash roll in.",
