            "notes": "## **$60,000**\nSell [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and buy [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). You're gonna need that added ability power to really make [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) a powerful pick. Not to mention the overhealth when you ult will make your Valk's just that much more viable and keep you out of many sticky situations! It even activates when you proc Renaissance!\n\n## **Under $60,000**\nI fear I'm gonna have to say what I've said every other round. Buy what you can and godspeed my friend.\n\n## **Playstyle:**\nYou should be the true unkillable moth you came here to be. You've gotten your bag, but those pesky enemies are still fighting strong. Rez and Valk whenever you can, watch your angles, and as always, keep yourself alive to keep your team alive.\n\nGood luck!!!!",
